{
    "title": "Minni Family Home - Play House",
    "description": "Explore your aesthetic skills to build up your little universe! \r\n\r\nPretend To Play is an addicting home design makeover game for kids. Create your dream family house with all the household objects and characters. Play home games to build exciting stories. However, the design home game is a perfect combination of fun and cuteness. \r\n\r\nOur home family games allow you to have a complete family of 5 members, including mother, father, a twin male and female, and a baby. Customize characters with cute apparel, skin colors, hairstyles, eyes appearance and even facial expressions. Unlock all the rooms and outfits. You can also enjoy day and night modes to create realistic stories. \r\n\r\nThere are 8 different rooms in the house, including living room, kids' room, parents' room, porch, kitchen, backyard garden, pool, and bathroom. You can move into different portions to explore adventures and keep things organized. These attributes make it one of the cool games for girls who wanna learn home d\u00e9cor and other household activities. \r\n\r\nFascinating objects and high-quality graphics keep your kids engaged with the fun kid games. Interestingly, these are role playing games for kids where they can implement their creative skills. Toca. Even these are cute home design games for players who are in dire need of exquisite fun!\r\n\r\nInteract with characters and things to design your home sweet home in play house miga games! \r\n\r\n== Cute Home Games\r\nPretend To Play learn home game brings a lot more than your expectations. Excellent simulations and digital characters make it one of the best home games for toddlers. However, you can perform tasks like cleaning the room, cooking in the kitchen, having meal with your family, etc.\r\n\r\n== Characters Customization\r\nChanging your characters\u2019 emotions and outlook is now at your fingertips. You can customize all the family members with different hairstyles, eyes, expressions, skins and clothes. It doubles the fun when you experience characters customization with your friends. \r\n\r\n== Create Unlimited Stories\r\nDo you love to decorate your home for different events and festivals? Here you can practice everything to create impressive stories. There are dozens of items to change your house appearance. \r\n\r\n== Build Your Dream House\r\nA pack of mesmerizing and soothing adventures is waiting for you to explore. Different rooms, characters, and objects help you design home dream makeover for free. These are fun games for girls to play with home stuff.\r\n\r\n== Easy Gameplay\r\nPretend To Play game has salient features and simple functionality to improve the users\u2019 experience. You can handle the gameplay with your fingertips. Keep tapping and dragging the items around to arrange them up to your desires.  \r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\nInteractive and user-friendly interface\r\nHigh-quality, colorful and elegant graphics\r\nCustomizable options and intuitive controls\r\nRole play games for family life stories \r\nAdorable home with family characters\r\nIncludes both day and night environments\r\n\r\nSpark your delightful ideas and develop a creative hobby with this home designing game! \r\n\r\nThank you for being here!\r\n\r\nYou can check our PRIVACY POLICY HERE https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicy-kdomogames/home",
